    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「まぁ、いいですけど。どんな勝負であろうと、わたしは譲る気はありません」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-c-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-c-snow_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「けれど。あのふたり、なぜスケートをしているのでしょう？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-c-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-c-snow_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「あぁ……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「園芸部が畑のために敷いた用水路が氷結して、ちょっとしたスケートリンクみたいになってるっぽいよ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「みどりん、早く畑を復活させたいらしくて後輩の子にドリルで掘らせようとしてたけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「遠見くんがそれを止めさせて、遊び場にしちゃった」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「遠見くん、ちょちょいとスケート靴とかこしらえちゃってさ。スケートのやりかたは転校生に教わってるみたい、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「転校生は何でもできるよね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「あの凍りついた地底湖を滑って毎朝、登校するつもりみたいだよ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「そっちのほうが近いんだって。遠見くんは、自分が楽をするためには努力を惜しまないよね～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-c-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-c-snow_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
